{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep5/quest_story/15110090.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1511009001:0":{"text":"권능의 큐브라면... 설마 신의 권력과 연관이 있는 건가?","source_cn":"权能之楔……莫非会和神权有关？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C668D265B3C7826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511009002:0":{"text":"아, 신들의 난투전을 직접 볼 수 있다면 얼마나 좋을까!","source_cn":"啊，要是有机会目睹一场诸神混战该有多好啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x187524240E395518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511009003:0":{"text":"그럼 재앙이 다가올 거예요.","source_cn":"那会带来灾难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6055B99DE805A564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511009004:0":{"text":"봉인의 큐브를 설치한 건 신이지만, 신의 권능이 깃들어 있지는 않을 거예요. 오히려 세상을 창조하는 원시적인 힘에 더 가깝죠.","source_cn":"封印之楔虽为诸神所设，但它不会承载诸神的权能，更趋近于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x469639DBA2C46644","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511009005:0":{"text":"이제 상징적인 권능, 그 힘 자체와 마주하게 될 거예요. 단단히 준비해 두세요.","source_cn":"我们将要面对象征权能本身的力量。做好准备吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF39387BFE50783B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep5/quest_story/15201100.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:1:1520110001:1":{"text":"초대 멀린의 마력이 우리를 감싸더니, 순식간에 권능의 큐브 영역으로 텔레포트되었다","source_cn":"初代梅林的魔力包围了你们，将你们传送到权能之楔的领域","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACA03FA64499EC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":0}},"locales/kr/ep5/quest_story/15201120.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201120","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1520112001:0":{"text":"권능의 큐브와 이렇게 가까운 곳으로 텔레포트하다니.","source_cn":"居然传送到了离权能之楔这么近的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06348960703B519C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520112002:0":{"text":"좋아, 덕분에 수고를 좀 덜겠군.","source_cn":"也好，这样省了不少麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x176293AB6F7331EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520112003:0":{"text":"다가가서 봉인을 풀 수 있는지 볼까요.","source_cn":"上前看看，找机会解除它的封印。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34E34DE0EC600D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"모르간","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep5/quest_story/15201170.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201170","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1520117001:0":{"text":"우리 위치가 바뀌었어. 이 권능의 큐브, 대체 뭐야?","source_cn":"我们换位置了，这个权能之楔是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC3492B43D4AEC8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520117002:0":{"text":"권능은... <style=\"highlight\">바람의 힘</style>을 의미해요.","source_cn":"权能——意味着<style=highlight>风的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12185DE883BBDC49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520117003:0":{"text":"돌풍으로 저희를 출발 지점까지 날려 보냈네요. 도전은 이제부터 시작이에요.","source_cn":"它用狂风将我们送到了真正的起点。挑战将从这里开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5BC3527C34D2329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1520117003":{"text":"돌풍으로 저희를 출발 지점까지 날려 보냈네요. 도전은 이제부터 시작이에요.","source_cn":"它用狂风将我们送到了真正的起点。挑战将从这里开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5BC3527C34D2329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520117004:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 이 섬에 부두가 있어요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B27F5BE72655FB0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 이 섬에 부두가 있어요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 이 섬에 부두가 있어요.","variant_male_record_index":"175803","variant_female_record_index":"175804","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520117005:0":{"text":"아무래도 다가가려면 반드시 <style=\"highlight\">물길로 가야겠군</style>.","source_cn":"看来，想要靠近它，必须要<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB5CFDAEB0F07B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520117006:0":{"text":"배에 타보자. 물 위는 잔잔하기를 바라자고.","source_cn":"走吧，我们乘船试试。但愿水上不要有狂风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18037F135D9E6DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"하지만 근처에 길이 없어","source_cn":"但附近没有路","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFED1EC0DB71BB58F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":